Package: dmux
Architecture: all
Depends: tmux, bash, ${misc:Depends}
Description: simple menu-driven front-end for tmux
 dmux provides a lightweight interactive menu for common tmux session
 management tasks. It can list, create, rename, kill, attach to, and switch
 between tmux sessions without requiring users to remember tmux commands.
